 "_about": "Three anomaly materials of the ported 0.21 maps take 0.21d's own look back. The port gives a ported material the values of 0.26g's material of the same name; for these three 0.26g redesigned the anomaly, so the 0.21 maps showed 0.26g's (the owner's screenshots of 2026-11-18: Fort's crystals red, Rudnya's swamp anomaly \"moving too fast\"). uran_crystals (Fort's crystals; 0.21d: green, a faint glow): the glow's multiplier 1 -> 0.21d's 0.1, no flicker, no scroll of the glow map along u, no subsurface scattering or its mask, no specular-intensity map, fresnel 0.4 -> 0.04, not a vegetation surface. cloud_mesh (Rudnya's swamp anomaly clouds): no uv distortion and no emissive map, neither of which 0.21d's has. anomaly_stalactite: no emissive flicker. Values read from retail 0.21d's material_instances of the same names; the native materials are untouched (these are the ported/v021d copies).",
